ve if their cards are all small or if they’re keeping a bomb), or  \n- Pass, letting my teammate play and possibly run their longer hand.  \n\nIf I play the pair of 10s and landlord passes, my teammate may struggle to beat it or waste higher pairs. Keeping my 10s gives me a chance to block small pairs later.  \n\n**Answer:**  \n{"cards": ["♠4"]}'}
